        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1482_5327.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpüerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear> diennst
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbietung</unclear> aller eeren, liebs unnd guotz zuovor.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Edel</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromm</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenvest</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürsichtig</unclear>, wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günnstig</unclear>, liebe
<lb n="4"/>Herren unnd guote <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünndt</unclear>. Wir werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstenndiget</unclear>,
<lb n="5"/>das ir uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesterigen</unclear> tag. Einen armen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bösen</unclear> mentschen,
<lb n="6"/>umb siner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beganngnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">boßhafften</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mißhanndlingen</unclear>,
<lb n="7"/>wegen, richten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dabi</unclear> ouch noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwoen</unclear> der-
<lb n="8"/>selbigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">argwoenischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlümbdeten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">personen</unclear> inn
<lb n="9"/>verwarung. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Soellen</unclear> ouch unnder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekenndt</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>haben, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lannger</unclear> kramer im <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lannd</unclear> hin unnd
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heer</unclear> zieche. So der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">boest</unclear> unnder allen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derglychen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">marderen</unclear>. Diewyl dann wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinnen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinstags</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sömlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdachtlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kramer</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgeben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sije</unclear> vier unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwoenntzig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stundt</unclear> ver-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gweßen</unclear>, ouch sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonnst</unclear> mit einem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünstling</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderen</unclear> sachen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungebürlich</unclear> erzeigt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gfen</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gklich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inziechen</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> thun erfragen
<lb n="18"/>lassen. Hat er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enndtlich</unclear> nach strennge der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überstanndnen</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/>marter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekenndt</unclear>. Das er unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> gesellen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zechnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">marden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">miteinannderen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verüebt</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wüsse</unclear> aber nit ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> gesellen noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhanden</unclear> oder
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">all</unclear> nit. Doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heisse</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hanns</persName>. Der
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annder</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Peeter</unclear></persName>. Der dritt <persName resp="#ner">Paulj</persName>. Der vierdt
<lb n="24"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Steffan</unclear></persName>. Unnd der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünnfft</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liennhard</unclear></persName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sijen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">all</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-15" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wienn</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Könne</unclear> aber ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">je</unclear> des
<lb n="26"/>übernamen nit nennen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. Derhalben so
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelanngt</unclear> an üch unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachpüerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pittn</unclear>, ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weellen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/>unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vom</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obrkait</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stür</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerechtigkeit</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigeren</unclear> schrifftlich berichten. Ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vilicht</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgethane</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menntsch</unclear> oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwoen</unclear> ge-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fanngnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">disem</unclear> lanngen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kramer</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> haben. Dann er sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nempt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Crista
<lb n="33"/>Bader</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haselperz</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-99" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Tyrol</placeName>. Oder ob ir diser
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wahrhaffteren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">boesen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">buben</unclear>, namen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">merer</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verzeichnet</unclear> haben. Damit wir unns
<lb n="36"/>gegen dem schuldigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desterbaß</unclear> zehandlen wüssen.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1482_5328.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="37"/>Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelcher</unclear> unnd
<lb n="38"/>derglychen sachen und faellen, gantz Nachpuerlich
<lb n="39"/>zubeschulden unnd zuverdienen.
<lb n="40"/>Gott samptlich wolbevolchen. Dat <origDate when="1605" resp="#ner">Frytags
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">8</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Julii</unclear>. Anno 1605</origDate>.
<lb n="42"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Statthaltter Vogtzrychs Schultheiß
<lb n="43"/>unnd Rath der Stat Wyl Im Thurgöuw</orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1482_5329.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1482_5330.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="44"/>Denen edlen fromen erenvesten fuersichtigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear> herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> Rath der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stat</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> Gallen</orgName> unnsern guenstigen
<lb n="47"/>lieben herren gueten fruenden und nachbaren.
</p>
